Spin up a debug pod quickly in Kubernetes:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: debug-pod
spec:
  containers:
  - name: debug
    image: nicolaka/netshoot
    command: ["/bin/bash"]
    args: ["-c", "sleep 3600"]
  restartPolicy: Never
```

```bash
kubectl apply -f debug-pod.yaml
kubectl exec -it debug-pod -- /bin/bash
```

The `netshoot` image comes with all the networking tools you need.
